{
    "word": "vinous",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                "word": "vinous",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bf2c96f9-eb0d-40fe-87ff-cbcba1c1cf3a",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more vinous"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2306ba85-5a67-4417-9897-d2c1dfa0b98f",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most vinous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6fdfd6c-fedb-3450-b3cf-68db69f8a1d8",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to or having the characteristics of wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "73d1ccef-cfb9-4106-951c-6c3f24a529bf",
                                "sense_id": "e6fdfd6c-fedb-3450-b3cf-68db69f8a1d8",
                                "text": "The man who firſt tranſplanted the grape of Burgundy to the Cape of Good Hope (obſerve he was a Dutchman) never dreamt of drinking the ſame wine at the Cape, that the ſame grape produced upon the French mountains—he was too phlegmatic for that—but undoubtedly he expected to drink ſome ſort of vinous liquor; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "257eba1c-1dd4-3f70-a9d2-2cf3e9b9baef",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to or having the characteristics of wine.",
                            "Involving the use of wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ecb65d3-bc36-4b66-9b5a-9f5fb4f3b8e6",
                                "sense_id": "257eba1c-1dd4-3f70-a9d2-2cf3e9b9baef",
                                "text": "The bride, in passing down stairs, dressed for her journey, found Tom waiting for her—flushed, either with his feelings, or the vinous part of the breakfast."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "89f04f78-e707-3a5c-b75a-11190104bac9",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to or having the characteristics of wine.",
                            "Having the colour of red wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "827f8cc0-8904-46f9-83aa-cda2aa566bce",
                                "sense_id": "89f04f78-e707-3a5c-b75a-11190104bac9",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: winelike, wine-dark, wine-blue"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b925ece9-b10d-4298-863c-f6947a4a3c3b",
                                "sense_id": "89f04f78-e707-3a5c-b75a-11190104bac9",
                                "text": "[…] François' quick eye detected the presence of some very small birds moving among the blossoms. They were at once pronounced to be humming-birds, and of that species known as the \"ruby-throats\" (Trochilus rolubris), so called, because a flake of a beautiful vinous colour under the throat of the males exhibits, in the sun, all the glancing glories of the ruby."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19a0e189-622a-4372-b3e3-31fb46916e16",
                                "sense_id": "89f04f78-e707-3a5c-b75a-11190104bac9",
                                "text": "Day was breaking, and the sheets of talc in the walls were filled with a vinous colour."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tending to drink wine excessively."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbc92e1e-c118-4e1c-927e-7d3878c2f0d6",
                                "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                                "text": "Yet fat and vinous old Jack Falstaff, whose portraiture is the happiest hit in all the varied range of English comedy, must be sought for in other scenes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71dc2821-aa93-438d-9274-ed8ac9f95422",
                                "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                                "text": "Curiosity induced him to ask the wild-eyed vinous old man if he knew the lady."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a9c356a-cf2b-4af2-b71d-73d415fa3c35",
                                "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                                "text": "Old Simon the Soaker now keeps a rare store / Of Malmsey and Malvoisie / In tub-fuls of hundreds of litres or more, / For a vinous old soul is he—e, / A porous old so—ul is he; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3d52677-c7f3-4ee4-bf7c-ec331d102fd0",
                                "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                                "text": "It is one of the most trying things about this life, this necessity of laughing uproariously when vinous old men say things that are dirty but not funny; else one is written down as a prig."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00626daf-f799-43b0-a80b-a3e28010d590",
                                "sense_id": "85f226bc-c931-35b6-8524-77d1920f12fd",
                                "text": "She was found wounded and amnesic by a vinous old farmer who, charitable and eccentric (or just radiantly bonkers), nursed her back to health in some ramshackle barn or outbuilding of his after the local Gendarmerie had investigated, photographed, swept up and hosed down the crash scene."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                        "entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Affected by the drinking of wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f899768-fd6e-42ea-a33f-1ee1527d5b52",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "The vinous Greek to whom he had address'd / His question, much too merry to divine / The questioner, fill'd up a glass of wine, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "747988af-f7a4-4c87-8fbb-fc8e56f67891",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "\"Come, come,\" said James, putting his hand to his nose and winking at his cousin with a pair of vinous eyes, \"no jokes, old boy; no trying it on on me.[…]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2b3545f-c45b-4912-a095-8e025bfaf522",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "Once she had been kissed by a man in wine (the memory recalled Lady Tynewood and the parties she gave) and she had never forgotten the hated smell of that vinous breath."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65d3a10a-afcd-4543-ab41-6f77486067e7",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "In a large bedroom upstairs, the window of which was thickly curtained with a great woollen shawl lately discarded by the landlady, Mrs. Rolliver, were gathered on this evening nearly a dozen persons, all seeking vinous bliss; all old inhabitants of the nearer end of Marlott, and frequenters of this retreat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a0d317b-c10a-4523-afd2-6c85b5d0bbcf",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "[S]he threw up her hands, sank into a chair and went off into a deep vinous sleep."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee2a3681-43b0-483b-8b89-275037381820",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "Gripped by a vinous pentecost, I launched into speech: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc8381b3-abc7-4cac-b622-9cf903980785",
                                "sense_id": "3af95e3e-0e38-3783-9a42-ff20523a13d2",
                                "text": "It was a moment of bathos and anticlimax; a poor sequel to my smoke-ringed, vinous reverie on American grandeur the previous night."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91eebce3-12e7-46c3-beef-6690e4aeac68",
                        "source_entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "source_sense_description": "pertaining to or having the characteristics of wine",
                        "target_lang_word": "wijnachtig",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wijnachtig",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f8e808b-bca6-34a5-81aa-c31c79d0c68b",
                                        "entry_id": "06cc0da9-967b-3765-b90a-799a54fa200f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gelijkend op, of eigenschappen hebbend van wijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f45843f-a478-47f2-aad8-93140781d20b",
                                                "sense_id": "4f8e808b-bca6-34a5-81aa-c31c79d0c68b",
                                                "text": "Deze bieren zijn zo krachtig van smaak en hebben zo'n hoog alcohol percentage dat ze eigenlijk op een wijnachtig manier gedronken moeten worden en dus niet als pils naar binnen geklokt kunnen worden om de dorst te lessen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "131bd5ed-cb3c-4987-9c33-06dfdf4fa099",
                        "source_entry_id": "181840fd-4159-361b-abef-743ec002bc55",
                        "source_sense_description": "pertaining to or having the characteristics of wine",
                        "target_lang_word": "vineux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vineux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfa78371-dd15-3472-9467-2049202aa0a2",
                                        "entry_id": "f9d6fd30-495f-32a8-9bd5-af88a7672f7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est fertile en vin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dec30141-d3ef-4a35-977c-deed7b896c45",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa78371-dd15-3472-9467-2049202aa0a2",
                                                "text": "Des coteaux vineux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "346968a9-e517-4ba5-a47f-d183d6b83194",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa78371-dd15-3472-9467-2049202aa0a2",
                                                "text": "Des campagnes vineuses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "215ed2b7-93cc-402a-ae9a-9c81122bf9c6",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa78371-dd15-3472-9467-2049202aa0a2",
                                                "text": "Une année vineuse, où il se fait beaucoup de vin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c54c4cd-f0d4-3b03-8ae6-12638ae766f2",
                                        "entry_id": "f9d6fd30-495f-32a8-9bd5-af88a7672f7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit du vin qui a beaucoup de force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6180b890-30d7-4438-b7d5-050e318170c3",
                                                "sense_id": "3c54c4cd-f0d4-3b03-8ae6-12638ae766f2",
                                                "text": "Ce vin est bien vineux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f95bff56-6f1e-3615-9878-bdb3c3607d9e",
                                        "entry_id": "f9d6fd30-495f-32a8-9bd5-af88a7672f7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a un goût, une odeur de vin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9844bec9-22e8-4155-82ce-ba002d58276f",
                                                "sense_id": "f95bff56-6f1e-3615-9878-bdb3c3607d9e",
                                                "text": "Pêche vineuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b0a2f73-a439-47a0-beda-18096fd633e4",
                                                "sense_id": "f95bff56-6f1e-3615-9878-bdb3c3607d9e",
                                                "text": "Melon vineux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7418a66-00d2-4c85-b319-ef6faa44fcba",
                                                "sense_id": "f95bff56-6f1e-3615-9878-bdb3c3607d9e",
                                                "text": "Les fraises sont vineuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                        "entry_id": "f9d6fd30-495f-32a8-9bd5-af88a7672f7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est de couleur rouge comme le vin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56a39039-d06e-4076-9998-61f97ae4340d",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Le même nid sert pour plusieurs couvées. La couleur des petits est d'abord d'un vineux grisâtre avec des raies fauves comme maillées. Les taches émeraudines n'apparaissent que dans la livrée adulte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5e7918b-160f-4200-9970-7258f2cc5902",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Le ciel rouge s’éteignait. Je regardais mourir ses reflets sur les vignes aux petites feuilles nouvelles, brillantes, vernissées, vineuses et dorées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c052c168-a1cc-4a46-8c20-89ba9e293d14",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Le ciel était devenu d’un brun vineux. Il n’y brillait plus aucune étoile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c439aa0a-ab79-4607-aa0b-606441cb9b24",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Couleur vineuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c965faa3-46ae-4060-b7a2-8ff30f22c40c",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Rouge vineux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65f21a70-3520-4a59-86e0-a580ef6939fa",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc48bc5-0ce0-3c5d-80e4-686a3054100e",
                                                "text": "Rouan vineux, se dit d’un cheval rouan, lorsque le bai domine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
